            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "We have studied all clinical trials with probiotics which are registered at ClinicalTrials.Gov. We focus on the clinical outcome parameters of the study as well as the (improvement of) quality of life of the patients involved. In the dataset all relevant parameters collected are included. The purpose of the dataset was to facilitate us to answer our research questions, and to search for correlations. The dataset also contains parameters which we have not analyzed in detail, but are free to be used by others."
                },
